      'pro.a1.t': 'RCICs & Immigration Consultants',
      'pro.a1.p': 'Your clients outside Canada need to mail sponsorship letters, statutory declarations, and cover letters to IRCC. You can mail on their behalf in minutes.',
      'pro.a2.t': 'Immigration Lawyers',
      'pro.a2.p': 'When a client\'s physical document needs to be mailed from inside Canada, such as a support letter, a reference or a printed form, Letterhome prints it and gets it into the mail for you.',
      'pro.a3.t': 'Paralegals & LTB Practitioners',
      'pro.a3.p': 'Non-resident landlords need to serve N4 notices, L1 applications, and other LTB documents on tenants in Ontario. We mail it from inside Canada via Canada Post.',
      'pro.a4.t': 'Property Managers',
      'pro.a4.p': 'Managing properties for owners abroad? When a tenant situation requires physical notice, Letterhome gets it mailed without the owner needing to fly back.',
      'pro.h2.get': 'What you get',
      'pro.g1': 'Letters to Canadian addresses are mailed from inside Canada via Canada Post',
      'pro.g2': 'Black & white printing by default (colour available for $1) on standard letter-size paper, up to 5 documents per order',
      'pro.g3': 'Email updates for every order, including the date each letter was mailed',
      'pro.g4': 'No account required. Order one at a time, or contact us for a discount code',
      'pro.g5': '$6 to Canada or the United States, $15 elsewhere, volume pricing from $5.50 per letter, <a href="/bulk-mailing">see bulk pricing</a>',
      'pro.g6': 'Replies to support queries within one business day',
      'pro.h2.codes': 'Discount codes for regular use',
      'pro.codes.p1': 'If you\'re regularly mailing documents on behalf of clients, get in touch and we\'ll set you up with a discount code to pass along or use yourself. No minimums, no contracts. The code gives your clients a discount at checkout.',
