      'cf.kenya.h': 'Posting a letter from Kenya: what to know',
      'cf.kenya.p0': 'About 29,000 people living in Canada were born in Kenya, according to the 2021 Census.',
      'cf.kenya.p1': 'Posta Kenya (the Postal Corporation of Kenya) is the national postal service of Kenya.',
      'cf.kenya.p2': 'Posta Kenya offers international letters by airmail, by surface, and by SAL (surface air lifted), which trades speed for price.',
      'cf.kenya.p3': 'For anything official, ask for registered mail at the counter: it comes with a tracking number and proof of posting, which an ordinary airmail letter does not.',
      'cf.kenya.near.h': 'Writing from a nearby country?',
