      'cf.lebanon.h': 'Posting a letter from Lebanon: what to know',
      'cf.lebanon.p0': 'About 96,000 people living in Canada were born in Lebanon, according to the 2021 Census.',
      'cf.lebanon.p1': 'LibanPost is the national postal service of Lebanon.',
      'cf.lebanon.p2': 'LibanPost suspended normal operations in March 2026 after the security situation deteriorated, then told the Universal Postal Union in July 2026 that it had resumed full inbound and outbound service across Lebanon.',
      'cf.lebanon.p3': 'Service can change quickly, so check with LibanPost before posting anything time-sensitive.',
      'cf.lebanon.near.h': 'Writing from a nearby country?',
