      'cf.mexico.h': 'Posting a letter from Mexico: what to know',
      'cf.mexico.p0': 'About 91,000 people living in Canada were born in Mexico, according to the 2021 Census.',
      'cf.mexico.p1': 'Correos de México is the national postal service of Mexico.',
      'cf.mexico.p2': 'In 2025 Correos de México restarted its own air mail service for the first time in about 15 years, flying mail with the state airline Mexicana.',
      'cf.mexico.p3': 'For anything official, ask for registered mail at the counter: it comes with a tracking number and proof of posting, which an ordinary airmail letter does not.',
