      'cf.nigeria.h': 'Posting a letter from Nigeria: what to know',
      'cf.nigeria.p0': 'About 81,000 people living in Canada were born in Nigeria, according to the 2021 Census.',
      'cf.nigeria.p1': 'NIPOST (the Nigerian Postal Service) is the national postal service of Nigeria.',
      'cf.nigeria.p2': 'In May 2025 NIPOST signed a direct international mail partnership with KLM. It had previously relied on several third-party handlers, which NIPOST itself linked to delays.',
      'cf.nigeria.p3': 'For anything official, ask for registered mail at the counter: it comes with a tracking number and proof of posting, which an ordinary airmail letter does not.',
      'cf.nigeria.near.h': 'Writing from a nearby country?',
