      'cf.pakistan.h': 'Posting a letter from Pakistan: what to know',
      'cf.pakistan.p0': 'About 234,000 people living in Canada were born in Pakistan, according to the 2021 Census.',
      'cf.pakistan.p1': 'Pakistan Post is the national postal service of Pakistan.',
      'cf.pakistan.p2': 'Pakistan Post\'s international letter tariff from 12 March 2026 places Canada in Zone A. Registration costs PKR 550 per item on top of the postage.',
      'cf.pakistan.p3': 'Ask for registered mail for anything official: you get a tracking number and proof of posting.',
      'cf.pakistan.near.h': 'Writing from a nearby country?',
