      'cf.philippines.h': 'Posting a letter from the Philippines: what to know',
      'cf.philippines.p0': 'About 720,000 people living in Canada were born in the Philippines, according to the 2021 Census.',
      'cf.philippines.p1': 'PHLPost (the Philippine Postal Corporation) is the national postal service of the Philippines.',
      'cf.philippines.p2': 'International routes can change quickly. In March 2026 PHLPost temporarily suspended outbound mail to 35 countries because of airspace closures at transit hubs, then gradually resumed service to many of them.',
      'cf.philippines.p3': 'Check the latest PHLPost advisory before posting anything time-sensitive.',
      'cf.philippines.near.h': 'Writing from a nearby country?',
