      'cf.singapore.h': 'Posting a letter from Singapore: what to know',
      'cf.singapore.p0': 'About 12,600 people living in Canada were born in Singapore, according to the 2021 Census.',
      'cf.singapore.p1': 'SingPost is the national postal service of Singapore.',
      'cf.singapore.p2': 'SingPost\'s airmail rate for a letter up to 20 g to Zone 3, which covers the Americas, has been S$1.55 since 1 January 2024, with S$0.35 for each additional 10 g.',
      'cf.singapore.p3': 'Registered mail costs more but comes with tracking.',
      'cf.singapore.near.h': 'Writing from a nearby country?',
