      'cf.south-africa.h': 'Posting a letter from South Africa: what to know',
      'cf.south-africa.p0': 'About 52,000 people living in Canada were born in South Africa, according to the 2021 Census.',
      'cf.south-africa.p1': 'The South African Post Office (SAPO) is the national postal service of South Africa.',
      'cf.south-africa.p2': 'SAPO has been in business rescue since 2023. It restarted international airmail in late 2023 to a limited list of countries and has added destinations since, so ask at the counter whether Canada is currently served.',
      'cf.south-africa.p3': 'For anything official, ask for registered mail at the counter: it comes with a tracking number and proof of posting, which an ordinary airmail letter does not.',
